    "title": "Sticker GO!",
    "description": "Sticker GO! is the first app that helps you complete your Monopoly GO! album.\r\nUsing it is super easy, you just need to update your album on Sticker GO! every time you receive a new sticker on Monopoly GO! and you can automatically receive or make exchange proposals with our whole community!\r\nFor each user, you can check the number of finalized and unfinalized exchanges, so you have an index of reliability and not to lose your stickers!\r\nThrough push notifications you will always be updated in real time on new proposals and friend requests!\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Download the app and see how easy it is to complete your Monopoly GO album!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.stickergo.app/privacy-policy/\r\nTerms and conditions: https://www.stickergo.app/terms-of-use/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Sticker GO! is the first app that helps you complete your Monopoly GO! album.<br>Using it is super easy, you just need to update your album on Sticker GO! every time you receive a new sticker on Monopoly GO! and you can automatically receive or make exchange proposals with our whole community!<br>For each user, you can check the number of finalized and unfinalized exchanges, so you have an index of reliability and not to lose your stickers!<br>Through push notifications you will always be updated in real time on new proposals and friend requests!<br><br>What are you waiting for? Download the app and see how easy it is to complete your Monopoly GO album!<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.stickergo.app/privacy-policy/<br>Terms and conditions: https://www.stickergo.app/terms-of-use/",
